### SKILL.md  [instructions]
- description: Automate YouTube video editing workflow: Download -> Transcribe (Whisper) -> Analyze (GPT-4) -> High-Quality Thumbnail (Text Overlay).
- version: 1.0.4
- - **🎨 AI Thumbnails (Pro):** Generates background with Nano Banana and overlays **crisp text** using custom fonts (no more AI gibberish text!).
- The skill installs basic deps automatically, but for thumbnail generation, you need **Playwright**:
- pip install playwright
- - **`NANO_BANANA_KEY`**: For image generation.
- - `bg_image.png` (Clean background)
